{"seq":2,"slug":"touch-virtual-controls","title":"触屏与虚拟摇杆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/practice/touch-virtual-controls","wordCount":1694,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"触屏与虚拟摇杆\">触屏与虚拟摇杆</h1><p>把一块没有任何凸起、没有任何触觉反馈的玻璃，变成能玩动作游戏的控制器，是移动端输入独有的难题。手柄的摇杆有归位弹簧、有边缘卡位，手指在玻璃上却感觉不到自己的拇指偏到哪去了。虚拟摇杆、虚拟按钮、滑动手势这些&quot;软控件&quot;要在缺失触觉的前提下做出能用的手感，还要对付误触、手指遮挡、屏幕尺寸千差万别。这一篇专讲移动端这套独有的工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>触屏输入的原始材料是一组带 id 的触点流：每个手指落下、移动、抬起都是带屏幕坐标的事件。软控件的工作是把这些裸触点解释成虚拟摇杆的方向、虚拟按钮的按下、或手势。难点在于触屏没有&quot;控件物理边界&quot;，一切边界都是软件画出来的约定，玩家看不见摸不着。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[触点流: id + 屏幕坐标 + 落/移/抬] --&gt; B[触点归属判定&lt;br/&gt;落在哪个软控件区域]&#10;  B --&gt; C{控件类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|虚拟摇杆| D[落点为锚, 偏移算方向&lt;br/&gt;固定式 or 浮动式]&#10;  C --&gt;|虚拟按钮| E[落在按钮热区即按下]&#10;  C --&gt;|手势| F[轨迹送手势识别]&#10;  D --&gt; G[动作: Move 矢量]&#10;  E --&gt; G2[动作: 按钮]&#10;  F --&gt; G3[动作: 招式 token]\">flowchart TD\n  A[触点流: id + 屏幕坐标 + 落/移/抬] --&gt; B[触点归属判定&lt;br/&gt;落在哪个软控件区域]\n  B --&gt; C{控件类型}\n  C --&gt;|虚拟摇杆| D[落点为锚, 偏移算方向&lt;br/&gt;固定式 or 浮动式]\n  C --&gt;|虚拟按钮| E[落在按钮热区即按下]\n  C --&gt;|手势| F[轨迹送手势识别]\n  D --&gt; G[动作: Move 矢量]\n  E --&gt; G2[动作: 按钮]\n  F --&gt; G3[动作: 招式 token]</pre><p>虚拟摇杆有两种主流形态，下表对比其取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>锚点</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定式</td>\n<td>屏幕固定位置</td>\n<td>位置可预期，UI 清晰</td>\n<td>手指要先找到摇杆，易偏移</td>\n<td>休闲、有视觉占位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮动式</td>\n<td>手指落点即锚点</td>\n<td>落哪都能控，无需找位置</td>\n<td>无固定参照，新手易迷失</td>\n<td>重度动作、硬核手游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合式</td>\n<td>区域内浮动</td>\n<td>兼顾可预期与灵活</td>\n<td>实现略复杂</td>\n<td>多数现代动作手游</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>浮动式是 2026 年重度动作手游的主流——玩家拇指落在屏幕左半区任意处，该点成为摇杆中心，后续偏移决定方向，松手即归位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"死区-灵敏度与无触觉补偿\">死区、灵敏度与无触觉补偿</h2><p>虚拟摇杆的方向由手指相对锚点的偏移算出，与物理摇杆共享 <a href=\"../mapping/action-mapping\">动作映射</a> 的矢量逻辑，但因缺触觉要额外补偿。偏移到方向的映射通常是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>touch</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext>anchor</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{d} = \\text{clamp}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\vec{p}_{\\text{touch}} - \\vec{p}_{\\text{anchor}}}{R_{\\max}},\\ 1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.391em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">touch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">anchor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是达到满速所需的半径。关键参数有三：<strong>死区半径</strong>（中心附近不响应，避免拇指微颤导致漂移）、<strong>满速半径</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（多大偏移算满速，太大则需大幅滑动、太小则太灵敏）、以及<strong>回中策略</strong>（物理摇杆松手自动归零，虚拟摇杆松手即触点消失，要显式归零）。把&quot;触点归属&quot;与&quot;偏移到方向&quot;两步写出来，虚拟摇杆的骨骼就清楚了：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct VStick { int ownerId = -1; Vec2 anchor; Vec2 dir; float deadzone, rMax; };&#10;&#10;void onTouchDown(VStick&amp; s, int id, Vec2 p) {&#10;    if (s.ownerId != -1) return;                 // 已有手指控杆 → 忽略，防多点夺控&#10;    s.ownerId = id; s.anchor = p;                // 浮动式：落点即锚点&#10;}&#10;void onTouchMove(VStick&amp; s, int id, Vec2 p) {&#10;    if (id != s.ownerId) return;                 // 非归属触点不影响本杆&#10;    Vec2 d = (p - s.anchor) / s.rMax;&#10;    float len = length(d);&#10;    s.dir = (len &lt; s.deadzone) ? Vec2{0,0}&#10;          : normalize(d) * std::min((len - s.deadzone) / (1.f - s.deadzone), 1.f);&#10;    if (len &gt; kReanchorDist) s.anchor = p - normalize(d) * kReanchorDist;  // 重锚：模拟&quot;推到底不出界&quot;&#10;}&#10;void onTouchUp(VStick&amp; s, int id) {&#10;    if (id == s.ownerId) { s.ownerId = -1; s.dir = {0,0}; }   // 松手显式归零&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VStick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ownerId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; Vec2 anchor; Vec2 dir; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadzone, rMax; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onTouchDown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VStick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vec2</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s.ownerId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki